21. The invariant:

      This is perhaps the most important sentence for your L6 preparation:
                
                At recursion state (row, col, index), the cells selected along the current path 
                spell word[0..index-1], and (row, col) is the next cell being considered for word[index].
                
       After returning: the grid's visited state is restored

