22. Compare this with Palindrome Partitioning:                  
                  This is an important progression.
                  
                  Palindrome Partitioning
                          State:
                          start                  
                  Choice:
                          choose end boundary                  
                  Constraint:
                              substring must be palindrome

                  Word Search
                        State:
                        row + col + index                  
                  Choice:
                        up/down/left/right                  
                  Constraint:
                          character must match + cell cannot be reused
                  
                  The backtracking template hasn't changed.                  
                  Only the state and legal-choice function changed.                  
                  That's exactly the kind of pattern abstraction we want at L6.

