23. Compare the major backtracking problems you've learned:

| Problem                 | State                 | Choices            | Main constraint               |
| ----------------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------- |
| Subsets                 | `index, path`         | include/exclude    | none                          |
| Subsets II              | `start, path`         | choose candidate   | duplicate siblings            |
| Combination Sum         | `start, target, path` | choose candidate   | target                        |
| Combination Sum II      | `start, target, path` | choose candidate   | target + duplicates           |
| Generate Parentheses    | `open, close, path`   | `(` / `)`          | balance                       |
| Letter Combinations     | `index, path`         | mapped chars       | digit mapping                 |
| Palindrome Partitioning | `start, path`         | substring boundary | palindrome                    |
| Word Search             | row, col, index**     | 4 directions       | character + no cell reuse     |

The reusable abstraction is:
                                STATE
                                   ↓
                                LEGAL CHOICES
                                   ↓
                                CHOOSE
                                   ↓
                                RECURSE
                                   ↓
                                UNDO
